    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100746" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύννοος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
			Att.
		
		
			contr.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συννόμ-νους</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ουν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in deep thought, thoughtful</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				1.15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.206b
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. πρὸς ἑαυτῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Them.</u>
					3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>anxious, gloomy</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βλέμμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					958a18
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				4.66
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>grave</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Medic.</u>
				1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>thoughtful, circumspect</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. γενέσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1267a36
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Vit.</u>
				p.13
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i></div>
